 "text": "Parcel Search | Morris County, KS\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nAbout\nDepartments\nServices\nCommissioners\nHow Do I...?\nSearch\nAbout Us\nAppeals\nFair Market Value\nForms\nGIS Web Mapping Service\nMarket Study Analysis\nParcel Search\nPersonal Property\nPersonal Property Online Listing\nResourceful Links\nHome\nDepartments\nAppraiser\nParcel Search\nParcel Search\nPublic and Registered User Parcel Search\nPublic Search:\nDisplays parcel information for all parcels in Morris County excluding sales information. There is no fee for the Public Search.\nRegistered User Search:\nThe Registered User Search is for Fee Appraiser's. Displays parcel information for all parcels in Morris County including sales information. If you would like to become a Registered User please contact the Appraiser's office for an application. This Registered User Site is free for the 2022 calendar year.\nPublic and Registered Users can click the links below to do a parcel search.\nParcel Search\nPublic Tax Information Search\nContact Us\nAppraiser\nPhysical Address\nView Map\nMorris County Appraiser\n501 W Main Street\nCouncil Grove , KS 66846\nMorris County Appraiser 501 W Main Street Council Grove KS 66846\nDirections\nPhone: 620-767-5533\nOnline Payments\nForms & Documents\nAgendas & Minutes\nTax Information\nEmployment\nDirectory\nSocial Media\nContact Us\nMorris County, Kansas\n501 W Main Street\nCouncil Grove, KS 66846\nPhone: 620-767-5518\nHours: Mon-Fri 8AM-5pM\nClosed Saturdays and County Holidays\nQuick Links\nSubscribe to E-Alerts\nQuick Links Title Sample\nQuick Links\nQuick Links Title\nQuick Links Title Sample\nQuick Links Title Sample\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×",
